  "body": "<!-- Release notes generated using configuration in .github/release.yml at main -->\r\n\r\n## What's Changed\r\n* formula: skip Java splash screens in macOS tests by @ashr123 in https://github.com/Homebrew/brew/pull/24005\r\n* Add brew advisory-match --formula-list by @p-linnane in https://github.com/Homebrew/brew/pull/24007\r\n* Update Ubuntu release cycle link by @MikeMcQuaid in https://github.com/Homebrew/brew/pull/24012\r\n* shell: emit a PowerShell assignment from export_value by @rawsun007 in https://github.com/Homebrew/brew/pull/24010\r\n* Avoid sudo for user-local cask app groups by @MikeMcQuaid in https://github.com/Homebrew/brew/pull/24011\r\n* Derive service completions from Cellar paths by @p-linnane in https://github.com/Homebrew/brew/pull/24009\r\n* Prefer Homebrew Python for uv tools by @MikeMcQuaid in https://github.com/Homebrew/brew/pull/24014\r\n* contributions: match co-authored commits made under a real name/email by @iMichka in https://github.com/Homebrew/brew/pull/23926\r\n* cask: improve consistency of rename handling by @MikeMcQuaid in https://github.com/Homebrew/brew/pull/24016\r\n* Keep parsed and evaled stdout free of warnings by @MikeMcQuaid in https://github.com/Homebrew/brew/pull/24015\r\n* pkg: run Git as the installation user by @MikeMcQuaid in https://github.com/Homebrew/brew/pull/24019\r\n* github_git_download_strategy: fetch when GitHub API is unavailable by @dawidd6 in https://github.com/Homebrew/brew/pull/24022\r\n\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Homebrew/brew/compare/7.0.3...7.0.4",
